# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of what OS or
# editor checked them out with. Without this, Windows + core.autocrlf=true
# can make Git (and any GUI that trusts `git status`, like VS Code) think
# unmodified files are "changed" purely over CRLF-vs-LF bookkeeping.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
